flowchart LR
    R[Runtime v3 events] --> X[runtime_v3_redacted]
    X --> M[Master log and CloudWatch\nrequired sinks]
    X --> B[Archive-only disk buffer\n512 MiB, drop newest]
    B -->|5 MiB or 60 s\n5 retries, 30 s cap| S[(Private S3 log archive)]
    B --> T[Archive failure and drop telemetry]
    TF[Terraform] --> S
    TF --> I[IAM publisher policy]
    I --> B
    S --> L[Encryption, versioning,\nretention lifecycle]
    U[S3 unavailable] -. healthcheck disabled .-> B
    U -. no backpressure .-> M
    R --> H[Runtime health and recovery]
    U -. no readiness dependency .-> H
